        <div class="dq-num">05</div>
        <div>
          <p class="dq-text">Visit the community / incubator the growth guy mentioned. Also the crypto community he flagged.</p>
          <span class="dq-purpose">Different rooms, possibly different problems, possibly different budgets.</span>
