      <div class="dq" style="background: var(--paper-warm); padding: 18px 16px; margin-top: 8px; border-bottom: none; border-radius: 2px;">
        <div class="dq-num" style="color: var(--accent);">08</div>
        <div>
          <p class="dq-text" style="font-weight: 500;">Keep doing sales. Keep talking to people. Keep diagnosing their problems. Keep evolving the service offering until it matches something they'll actually fund.</p>
